{"type":"message","id":"d99cc541","parentId":"188b7577","timestamp":"2026-03-13T09:07:51.107Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm consistently hitting rate limits on ClawHub. This is making it difficult to complete the full evolution task as requested. However, I was able to:\n\n1. Successfully search for skills in the notes, productivity, automation, calendar, and document categories\n2. Found that most high-rated skills are already installed\n3. Successfully installed one new skill: voice-notes\n4. Identified other potentially valuable skills but couldn't install due to rate limiting\n\nLet me now generate the evolution report with what I was able to accomplish.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在生成进化报告。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1c0dd884f6cd44baa7f2c2f9","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu/memory/evolution-2026-03-13.md","content":"# 技能进化报告 - 2026-03-13\n\n## 执行时间\n2026年3月13日 17:03 (北京时间)\n\n## 搜索结果汇总\n\n### 高评分技能发现 (评分 > 3.5)\n\n**日历类 (Calendar):**\n- calendar (3.704) ✓ 已安装\n- gcalcli-calendar (3.655) ✓ 已安装\n- feishu-calendar (3.626) - 飞书日历集成\n- lark-calendar (3.588) ✓ 已安装\n\n**笔记类 (Notes):**\n- apple-notes (3.690) ✓ 已安装\n- bear-notes (3.606) ✓ 已安装\n- ai-meeting-notes (3.579) ✓ 已安装\n\n**文档类 (Document):**\n- document-pro (3.496) ✓ 已安装\n- document-summary (3.396) ✓ 已安装\n\n**生产力类 (Productivity):**\n- productivity (3.563) ✓ 已安装\n- afrexai-productivity-system (3.342)\n\n**自动化类 (Automation):**\n- automation-workflows (3.746) ✓ 已安装\n- ai-web-automation (3.591)\n\n## 安装情况\n\n### ✅ 新安装技能\n1. **voice-notes** - 语音笔记技能\n   - 评分: 3.372\n   - 功能: 语音转笔记能力\n   - 状态: 安装成功\n\n### ⚠️ 未能安装（API 速率限制）\n- ai-web-automation (3.591)\n- feishu-calendar (3.626)\n- 其他搜索到的技能\n\n### ✓ 已安装核心技能（共46个）\n主要技能包括：\n- 日历管理: calendar, gcalcli-calendar, macos-calendar, lark-calendar\n- 任务管理: task, todoist, things-mac, trello\n- 文档处理: document-pro, document-summary, obsidian\n- 笔记系统: apple-notes, bear-notes, flomo-notes\n- 会议管理: ai-meeting-notes, meeting-prep, meeting-to-action\n- 自动化: automation-workflows\n- 搜索能力: brave-search, multi-search-engine\n\n## 分析评估\n\n### 优势\n1. **核心技能齐全** - 主要的高评分技能（>3.5）都已安装\n2. **覆盖面广** - 日历、任务、文档、笔记、会议、自动化等领域均有覆盖\n3. **新增语音能力** - voice-notes 提供了语音转笔记的新能力\n\n### 限制\n1. **ClawHub API 速率限制** - 多次搜索和安装请求被限流\n2. **无法验证下载量和更新时间** - API 限制导致无法完成完整的筛选条件检查\n\n### 建议\n1. **分时段执行** - 建议将进化任务分散到不同时间段，避免 API 限流\n2. **优先级安装** - 先安装评分最高的技能，再考虑其他\n3. **定期更新** - 虽然本次更新失败，但应保持定期尝试更新已安装技能\n\n## 下次进化建议\n\n1. 等待 API 限流解除后继续尝试安装：\n   - ai-web-automation\n   - feishu-calendar（对公司飞书使用有价值）\n   \n2. 考虑更新的技能：\n   - automation-workflows (当前版本 0.1.0，可能有更新)\n   - 其他核心技能的版本更新\n\n3. 评估新出现的技能领域：\n   - AI 驱动的自动化工具\n   - 跨平台集成工具\n\n---\n报告生成时间: 2026-03-13 17:15\n下次执行建议: 2026-03-14 09:00 (避开高峰期)\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":103,"output":970,"cacheRead":19264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20337,"cost":{"input":0.000103,"output":0.0031040000000000004,"cacheRead":0.0038528000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007059800000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773392841912}}
